        <mxCell id="c6" value="What happens&lt;br&gt;Overlapping boxes are pushed apart a little, each by a small bounded amount. Arrows attached to boxes follow them. Sizes and fonts stay as they were." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=13;" parent="1" vertex="1">
