        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c7" value="What the business should expect&lt;br&gt;Heavy overlap cannot be fully fixed within the limits. The tool reports what is left instead of scattering the diagram. Options: raise the limits (more movement, smaller boxes), or re-layout manually." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=13;" parent="1" vertex="1">
