        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c7" value="What the business should expect&lt;br&gt;Contradictory instructions (keep both fixed + remove the overlap) end with a report, not a guess. The agent must tell the user which constraint to relax." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=13;" parent="1" vertex="1">
